# Verify and hand off a working app

**Full procedure:** [`.cursor/skills/agent-ui/SKILL.md`](../skills/agent-ui/SKILL.md).

After app-affecting Expo changes, prove the surface on **both** iOS (iPhone 17 Pro) and Android (Galaxy_S26). Prefer:

```bash
./scripts/agent-ui-verify-both.sh --route <path> [--flow <name>] --exists <id> …
```

Paste both assert outputs. Exceptions: pure docs/rules, host-only scripts, or user scoped one platform.

- Pin `AGENT_UI_PLATFORM=android` for Android; clear before iOS (sticky pin breaks default).
- Reuse Metro when healthy; agents use `packager:ensure:start` — never `npm start` in agent shells.
- Assert/`--color` then **STOP** — no ritual handoff screenshot.
- Leave devices on the changed surface (not splash/blank/error/unrelated tab).
